CARB='https://edu.rsc.org/resources/carbonyl-chemistry-16-18/4010284.article'
ACID='https://openstax.org/books/chemistry-2e/pages/14-2-ph-and-poh'
CAT='https://openstax.org/books/chemistry-2e/pages/12-7-catalysis'

no(561,'Neoprene is independently polychloroprene, but the printed sodium polymerisation condition needs verification; primary ACS history describes chloroprene polymerisation without establishing sodium as this initiator. Hold this exact process claim rather than silently delete the condition.',answer='D polymer identity')
